Lord of War is a crime, drama, thriller film directed by Andrew Niccol.

3
00:16:38,181 --> 00:16:44,181
Yuri Orlov is a globetrotting arms dealer and, through some of the deadliest war zones, he struggles to stay one step ahead of a relentless
Interpol agent, his business rivals and even some of his customers who include many of the world's most notorious dictators.

4
